This product is a Go server for FydeOS Notes. It speaks the client protocols
of the AFFiNE editor that FydeOS Notes is built on, so some protocol names,
HTTP headers, cookie names, document block types and environment variables
contain the word "affine". These names are kept only for compatibility with
existing clients, documents and deployments. This product is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by TOEVERYTHING PTE. LTD. or the AFFiNE
project. "AFFiNE" is a trademark of its respective owner.

